[[63,7,512,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Using the tool (1a), prise off the retaining clip (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.034.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the handle (2a) and recover the spacer (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003131.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,512,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>First position the spacer and then the window lift handle.</p><p>Fit the retaining clip.</p>"]]